{"_id":"EntFloraInA00001","name":"Spell Effect: Entangling Flora (Inside Area)","type":"effect","img":"modules/pf2e-vibemodulerp/img/entangling-flora-inside-area.webp","folder":null,"system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J6vNvrUT3b1hx2iA]{Entangling Flora}</p>\n<p>This effect is granted to creatures that are inside the area.</p>\n<p>Each round that the creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a DC 20 Reflex save. On a failure, it gains @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.rjM25qfw5BKj9h97]{Spell Effect: Entangling Flora}, and on a critical failure, it also gains @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round. A creature can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} to remove these effects.</p>"},"duration":{"expiry":null,"sustained":false,"unit":"unlimited","value":-1},"level":{"value":2},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"rules":[],"start":{"initiative":null,"value":0},"tokenIcon":{"show":true},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"slug":"spell-effect-entangling-flora-inside-area","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"effects":[],"flags":{},"_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.4.0","createdBySource":""}}
